    "narrative": "The Austin Waves are positioned for a high-ceiling outing today, headlined by **Gunnar Henderson**, who earns our premier efficiency score of 81.88 against Emerson Hancock. **Gunnar Henderson** benefits from a massive park factor boost and favorable platoon dynamics that comfortably outweigh the marginal risk posed by Hancock\u2019s efficiency. Complementing this, **Miguel Andujar** (65.09) and **Jackson Merrill** (60.98) provide stable secondary production as they capitalize on a favorable matchup against Andrew Abbott. While **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** faces a tough assignment against the elite Cristopher S\u00e1nchez (xERA 2.74), his projected efficiency of 56.35 remains safe enough to roster, though he faces the steepest SP-related downgrade in our lineup today.\n\nOur most difficult roster decision involved keeping **Nasim Nunez** (42.65) on the bench in favor of starting **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** (59.62) and **Curtis Mead** (47.29). While **Nasim Nunez** possesses the elite sprint speed our strategy prioritizes, the decision tipped toward **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** due to a superior batting order position and higher base efficiency against the difficult Logan Webb. Because **Nasim Nunez** is currently projected in the 8-hole, the volume constraints outweigh his categorical speed upside for this specific slate. Managers should monitor official lineups closely, as **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.**, **Curtis Mead**, **Gunnar Henderson**, **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.**, **Coby Mayo**, **Miguel Andujar**, **Jackson Merrill**, and **Nolan Schanuel** are all currently \"Lineup Pending.\" We continue to monitor the status of **Kyle Tucker** and **Luis Robert Jr.**, who remain unavailable due to scheduling and injury, respectively, leaving **Andy Pages**, **Jordan Westburg**, **Jorge Polanco**, **Drake Baldwin**, **Josh Lowe**, **Jacob Wilson**, **Heliot Ramos**, **Sam Antonacci**, **Miguel Vargas**, **Josh Jung**, **Dominic Smith**, **Brayan Rocchio**, and **Liam Hicks** as depth options if late-breaking lineup changes occur.",
